        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "8d6f3134-a398-5b1a-becd-ea5f6693fb32",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Woo, Joseph Santley, Ti Lung, Leslie Cheung, Chow Yun-fat\n- Films: A Better Tomorrow\n- Roles: film director, writer, producer, actor, singer, dancer\n- Places: Hong Kong, China, United States\n\nFacts:\n- Joseph Mansfield Santley was born as Joseph Ishmael Mansfield on January 10, 1890, and he was an American actor, singer, dancer, writer, director, and producer of musical theatrical plays, motion pictures, and television shows.\n- John Woo, also known as Ng Yu-Sum, was born on May 1, 1946, and he is a Chinese-born Hong Kong film director, writer, and producer.\n- Joseph Santley died on August 8, 1971.\n- A Better Tomorrow is a 1986 Hong Kong crime film directed by John Woo.\n- A Better Tomorrow stars Ti Lung, Leslie Cheung, and Chow Yun-fat.",
